  "display_title": "Black Haze",
  "description": "Long ago, a \"door\" connecting to another world opened, and those who gained special abilities along with a \"mark\" began to be called \"wizards.\" After the incident of \"that day,\" Ophion's first-class wizard \"Blow\" became very famous. One day, he receives a very special request. It is to protect the second son of the Artian Duke family, who is being called a \"monster\" and suffering at the \"Magic School Helios\"! Thus, Blow enters Helios as a student under the name \"Rood Krisch\" while hiding his identity... Will Blow be able to successfully complete the request amidst the whirlwind of unexpected events?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
